TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, exchange, find NaX at step 4
SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell NaX_molality
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, MOL("NaX")
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -time_step 1
END
